      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَطُوطٌ</span></b>  <i>A declivity,</i> or <i>declivous place; a place
of descent,</i> or <i>by which one descends:</i> (S, TA:)
<i>a hill</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَمَةٌ</span>) <i>that is difficult of descent:</i> or,
accord. to IDrd, <i>a difficult</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَمَة</span>. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
(assumed tropical:)  An <i>excellent, swift</i> she-camel; (S, K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْحَطَّةٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

